    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "あうっ、これは関係ない話。んっとね、よく見て！　まちがい探しの時間です、今日のゆゆには『いつものゆゆ』とはちがうところがあります！　な～んだろ？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "考えてね～？　正解したら、ゆゆがギュッてしてあげる～♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "good",
    "position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ふんふふん、ふふ～ん……♪　はい、時間切れ～……☆"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "正解できなかったおに～さんには、えぐい罰ゲームが与えられます～♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "bliss",
    "position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/39/emo_laugh-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "えへへ。片足をノコギリで切り落とすのと、ビールジョッキ一杯ぶんの硝子の破片を飲みこむのと、どっちがいい？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ん？　そうだよ～、正解！　ゆゆ、今日はダニエルを抱っこしてないの！"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/angry1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/39/emo_angry-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "いつでも一緒なのにね～、今日はダニエルがいないの。すぐに気づいてよ、こんなのはサービス問題だよ？　おに～さん、サイコなホラー映画だったら死んでたよ？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ん～、んん。まぁいいや、『時間切れ』って宣言したあとだったけど正解したから。今回は見逃してあげる、罰ゲームは勘弁してあげるね～？　ゆゆ、優しいでしょ♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "じゃあね、第二問いくよ！　もっと楽しませてね～、おに～さん♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ふぇ？　あぁそうだね、おに～さんに『ダニエルになってもらう』のが目的だったね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/39/emo_embarrassed-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "謎かけするのが楽しくって、忘れてた～♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "じゃあ、謎かけはまた今度にするね。おに～さんが完全に油断して日常を過ごしてるときに、不意打ちで謎々をだすね？　油断しちゃ『めっ』だよ～、えへへ♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ん？　大丈夫だよ～、ダニエルはべつに捨てられちゃったとか行方不明とかじゃないの。それだったら、ゆゆはもっと取り乱してるもん。えっとね～、あのね～？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/39/emo_worry-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "……何だっけ。そうそう、いまダニエルはお洋服を新調してるの。いつも同じ服を着てるように見えるでしょ、ちがうんだよ～？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "定期的にね、新しいのにしてるの。地味にね、お洒落さんなの。ダニエルは『おばあちゃん』だけど、女の子だからファッションにはうるさいの～♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/sad2",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "こないだの雨の日にね、車に泥水をぶちまけられちゃって……。ダニエル、汚れちゃったの。"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ダニエルじたいはお風呂に入れてあげたりして、綺麗にしたんだけどね～？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "お洋服のほうは、ずっと着てたやつだから。この機会に、新調しようかと思ってるの。ゆゆ、がんばって手縫いでチクチクつくってるんだよ～？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/39/emo_joyful-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "子供のころから、何度かそういうふうにしてるからね。ゆゆ、お裁縫けっこう得意なんだ。たぶん傷口も縫えると思うから、大怪我したらゆゆに言ってね？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/ashamed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "あぅっ、また話がずれてる。えぇっとね、何の話してたっけ？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ゆゆ、あんまり長いこと同じ話題をつづけられないの。なぁんか、飽きちゃうんだよね～♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "あっ、そうだ。それでね、ダニエルいまお洋服がないの"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "古い衣装とか着せたり、簡単に布で覆ったりしてもいいんだけどね。そのへん、今日は用意が間にあわなくって"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "でも、『はだかんぼ』だと可哀想でしょ？　『おばあちゃん』だし、風邪ひいちゃうかも？　だからね、今日はダニエルはおうちでお留守番なの♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "寂しがってるだろうし、早く帰ってあげたいんだけどね～。でも今日一日、ダニエルを抱っこせずに過ごしてみたんだけどね。意外と、ゆゆは平気なの"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ダニエルを抱っこしてないと、不安になって、泣き叫んじゃうんだけど。今日はまだ、むずむずするけど、何とか大丈夫なの"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/39/emo_worry-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "それがね～、自分でも変な感じなんだよね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/sad2",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ゆゆも、他の子たちみたいに……。むかぁし、仲良く遊んでいたお友達を忘れちゃえるのかな。物置のなかに仕舞いこんでも、平気になっちゃうのかな"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "だって。ゆゆ以外の誰も、ダニエルみたいなのを抱っこしてないよ。これが『ふつう』なんだもんね、ゆゆのほうが変なんだよね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/39/emo_sad-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "でも。ゆゆはね、何だか怖くなっちゃうんだ。わかるかなぁ、おに～さん……。こういうのに、ダニエルがいないことに、慣れなくちゃいけないのかなぁ？"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "だって。みんな、褒めてくれたよ。ダニエルを抱っこしてないと、先生とかクラスのみんなとか。ようやく『まとも』になったね、偉いねって"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/angry2",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "偉くないよ！　ゆゆは、ゆゆだけはお友達を忘れない！　寂しいとき、苦しいときにダニエルはいつも一緒だった！　いっぱいいっぱい、助けられてきた！"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 39,
    "dress": "n-daniel",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "n-daniel_expression/cry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 410
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/39/emo_cry-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "なのに忘れちゃうのは、残酷だよ！　うあああ～ん……！"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆゆ",
    "text": "ふぇぇん、ぐじゅ！　おに～さん、抱っこして！　女の子が泣いてるのに、何でボケ～ッとしてるの！"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
